   "headline": "Lock and Wise: Two MVPs Each, Only One With Rings",
   "body": [
    "The quarterback who left the Giants as Lock arrived makes the cleanest comparison. Wise threw for 64,703 yards and 641 touchdowns in 347 games; Lock for 68,237 and 627 in 330. Each won 2 MVP awards. Wise was the safer passer by far, 62 interceptions to Lock's 137, and he never won a ring. Lock won 2, both before the trade. The final Career Legacy, 7,550 to 7,473, gives Lock the edge by a whisker."
   ],
